\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Spirit of wisdom, turn our eyes
\par From earth and earthly vanities
\par To heavenly truth and love;
\par Spirit of understanding true,
\par Our souls with heavenly light endue
\par To seek the things above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Spirit of counsel, be our guide;
\par Teach us, by earthly struggles tried,
\par Our heavenly crown to win:
\par Spirit of fortitude, Thy power
\par Be with us in temptation's hour,
\par To keep us pure from sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Spirit of knowledge, lead our feet
\par In Thine own paths, so safe and sweet,
\par By angel footsteps trod;
\par Where Thou our guardian true shalt be,
\par Spirit of gentle piety.
\par To keep us close to God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Through all our life be ever near,
\par Spirit of God's most holy fear,
\par In our heart's inmost shine;
\par Our souls with awful reverence fill,
\par To worship His most holy will,
\par All-righteous and divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. So lead us, Lord, through peace or strife,
\par Onward to everlasting life,
\par To win our high reward:
\par So may we fight our  lifelong fight,
\par Strong inThine own unearthly might,
\par And reign with Christ our Lord.\tab 
\par                                        Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
